ENS WEALTH MANAGEMENT WEALTH CENTER HAS OPENED AT 560 9TH STREET SOUTH, NAPLES, FL. WITH A TEAM OF ADVISORS THAT SPECIALIZE IN WEALTH MANAGEMENT, TAX AND ESTATE PLANNING AND SERVICES, THE LOCATION IS STAFFED BY A CAPABLE TEAM TO FULLY MEET THE NEEDS OF CLIENTS IN SOUTHWEST FLORIDA. RECOGNIZED AS A LEADING WEALTH ADVISOR WITH $23 BILLION IN ASSETS UNDER MANAGEMENT AND ADVISEMENT'}{'symbol': 'CTXS', 'date': '2022-05-02 08:30:00', 'title': 'CITRIX® ACHIEVES FEDRAMP MODERATE STATUS', 'text': "FORT LAUDERDALE, FLA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CITRIX SYSTEMS, INC. (NASDAQ: CTXS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ACHIEVED THE U.S. FEDERAL RISK AND AUTHORIZATION MANAGEMENT PROGRAM'S (FEDRAMP) MODERATE STATUS, CLEARING THE WAY FOR U.S. GOVERNMENT AGENCIES TO USE THE COMPANY'S MARKET-LEADING DIGITAL WORKSPACE SOLUTIONS TO EMPOWER SECURE WORK ANYWHERE, ANYTIME FROM ANY DEVICE. THE AUTHORIZATION WAS APPROVED FOR CITRIX CLOUD GOVERNMENT™ AND CITRIX DAAS BY THE FEDRAMP PROGRAM MANAGEMENT OFFICE (PMO) AND JOI"}{'symbol': 'CLX', 'date': '2022-05-02 16:10:00', 'title': 'CLOROX REPORTS Q3 FISCAL YEAR 2022 RESULTS, UPDATES OUTLOOK', 'text': 'OAKLAND, CALIF. , MAY 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE CLOROX COMPANY (NYSE: CLX) TODAY REPORTED RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF FISCAL YEAR 2022, WHICH ENDED MARCH 31, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2022-05-02 14:05:00', 'title': 'COMERICA APPOINTS SINERIA ORDÓÑEZ NATIONAL HISPANIC BUSINESS DEVELOPMENT MANAGER', 'text': "DALLAS , MAY 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- COMERICA BANK ANNOUNCED IT HAS APPOINTED SINERIA ORDÓÑEZ AS NATIONAL HISPANIC BUSINESS DEVELOPMENT MANAGER TO SUPPORT ITS ONGOING COMMITMENT TO STRENGTHENING RELATIONSHIPS WITH HISPANIC BUSINESS LEADERS, ENTREPRENEURS AND COMMUNITIES ACROSS ITS FIVE PRIMARY MARKETS OF CALIFORNIA, TEXAS, MICHIGAN, ARIZONA AND FLORIDA. THESE RESPONSIBILITIES ARE AN EXTENSION OF ORDÓÑEZ'S CURRENT ROLE AS VICE PRESIDENT, EXTERNAL AFFAIRS MARKET MANAGER – SOUTH TEXAS."}{'symbol': 'COP', 'date': '2022-05-02 08:30:00', 'title': 'CONO